{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2021-11-29 08:05:00', 'title': 'AFLAC CHIEF DIGITAL INFORMATION OFFICER RICH GILBERT NAMED A 2021 CIO OF THE YEAR® ORBIE AWARD WINNER', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, GA., NOV. 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFLAC, A LEADING PROVIDER OF SUPPLEMENTAL INSURANCE IN THE U.S., ANNOUNCED THAT CHIEF DIGITAL INFORMATION OFFICER RICH GILBERT WAS RECOGNIZED AS A 2021 CIO OF THE YEAR® HONOREE BY GEORGIACIO.'}